OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 12 APR
OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GLet Afrodeutsche be your guide
OL,6,     Ginto a sublime state of
OL,7,     Grelaxation. Her musical flow is
OL,8,     Gexactly what you need to start
OL,9,     Gyour Sunday morning just right.
OL,10,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,11,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,12,     Gof great music and chat for
OL,13,     Gweekend breakfast, plus they
OL,14,     Gcelebrate the 50th anniversary of
OL,15,     Gpioneering punk band the Ramones'
OL,16,     Gdebut album.
